From: Codex Agent <codex-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 19:20:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] xpu: guard Option 4 oracle capture bookkeeping

Fix non-contiguous compressor-state row capture and keep capture-only gathers and local WO_B exposure inactive outside armed forwards.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
